            At exactly 15:00 (3:00 PM) GMT, Japan reaches 00:00 midnight, advancing the calendar date into the next day.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div style="background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px; padding: 1.25rem;">
