          </p>
        </div>

        <div style="background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px; padding: 1.25rem;">
          <h3 style="margin: 0 0 0.5rem; font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--accent);">Example 10: Night GMT</h3>
          <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 0.93rem;">
            <strong>20:00 GMT → 05:00 JST (Next Day)</strong><br />
            20:00 (8:00 PM) GMT equals 05:00 AM JST on the next calendar day in Japan.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div style="background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px; padding: 1.25rem;">
          <h3 style="margin: 0 0 0.5rem; font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--accent);">Example 11: Half-Hour GMT</h3>
          <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 0.93rem;">
            <strong>21:30 GMT → 06:30 JST (Next Day)</strong><br />
            21:30 (9:30 PM) GMT translates to 06:30 AM JST early morning on the next day.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div style="background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px; padding: 1.25rem;">
          <h3 style="margin: 0 0 0.5rem; font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--accent);">Example 12: Late Night GMT</h3>
          <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 0.93rem;">
            <strong>23:30 GMT → 08:30 JST (Next Day)</strong><br />
            23:30 (11:30 PM) GMT equals 08:30 AM JST right as morning commutes begin in Tokyo on the next day.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div style="background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px; padding: 1.25rem;">
          <h3 style="margin: 0 0 0.5rem; font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--accent);">Example 13: New Year Eve Date Shift</h3>
          <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 0.93rem;">
            <strong>23:00 GMT (Dec 31, 2026) → 08:00 JST (Jan 1, 2027)</strong><br />
