        <li><strong>GMT 15:00:</strong> Results in JST 00:00 (midnight) on the <strong>NEXT calendar date</strong>.</li>
        <li><strong>GMT 18:00:</strong> Results in JST 03:00 AM on the <strong>NEXT calendar date</strong>.</li>
        <li><strong>GMT 23:00:</strong> Results in JST 08:00 AM on the <strong>NEXT calendar date</strong>.</li>
